Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2-10 Tensi\[OAcute]n superficial y viscosidad: Ley de Poiseuille", \
"Section",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0.5}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0, 0, 1],
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.935515845683177*^9, 3.935515849943137*^9}, {
   3.9356999575611343`*^9, 3.9356999632170334`*^9}, {3.939294636528504*^9, 
   3.939294642762233*^9}, {3.951589140619224*^9, 3.951589142010891*^9}, {
   3.951669940033366*^9, 3.9516699478229322`*^9}, {3.951670332399876*^9, 
   3.951670332931019*^9}, 3.960547930283841*^9, {3.969476521475095*^9, 
   3.969476526032505*^9}, {3.969476984571576*^9, 3.96947699172572*^9}, {
   3.9695684835982018`*^9, 3.969568484739417*^9}, {3.9700796643864136`*^9, 
   3.970079666361315*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Times New Roman",
 FontColor->GrayLevel[0],
 Background->RGBColor[
  1., 1., 0.],ExpressionUUID->"fce3ab39-5282-644a-8877-2b54876a34c2"],

Cell["\<\
En medicina, comprender c\[OAcute]mo se comportan los fluidos \
biol\[OAcute]gicos bajo distintas condiciones es fundamental. Propiedades \
como la tensi\[OAcute]n superficial y la viscosidad determinan procesos tan \
esenciales como la respiraci\[OAcute]n, la circulaci\[OAcute]n \
sangu\[IAcute]nea y la din\[AAcute]mica de secreciones pulmonares o mucosas. \
Estos conceptos permiten a los profesionales de la salud explicar, \
diagnosticar y tratar alteraciones fisiol\[OAcute]gicas que comprometen la \
vida.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9645267041633606`*^9, 3.9645267221833115`*^9}, 
   3.9646396929147224`*^9, {3.964639784987587*^9, 3.9646397897542*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"3e409629-ddda-9c4c-a277-96fc1eed649d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Principios de la Tensi\[OAcute]n Superficial", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9645288127733765`*^9, 3.964528823262932*^9}, {
   3.9646350699043674`*^9, 3.9646350834553127`*^9}, 3.9646396944969864`*^9, {
   3.9646953444384956`*^9, 3.9646953494892826`*^9}, {3.9653918200231323`*^9, 
   3.9653918216132736`*^9}, {3.965391943017185*^9, 
   3.96539194517408*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8c403a37-ad42-084c-9b57-\
c4490db8d546"],

Cell["\<\
La tensi\[OAcute]n superficial es la fuerza que act\[UAcute]a en la \
superficie de un l\[IAcute]quido y que tiende a minimizar el \[AAcute]rea \
superficial. La cohesi\[OAcute]n intermolecular en la superficie libre de los \
l\[IAcute]quidos hace que para deformar su superficie se requiera una cierta \
energ\[IAcute]a, lo que indica que presenta una resistencia a ser atravesado \
a su vez que presenta una resistencia para que su superficie pueda ser \
aumentada. 

Por ello, el coeficiente de tensi\[OAcute]n superficial (\[Gamma]), que \
depende de las condiciones intr\[IAcute]nsecas del fluido, se define como la \
energ\[IAcute]a utilizada para aumentar la superficie:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96478769850898*^9, 3.964787719038368*^9}, {
   3.9653878013831806`*^9, 3.965387866841913*^9}, {3.9653878988359947`*^9, 
   3.965387899473936*^9}, {3.9653883644552097`*^9, 3.965388444688532*^9}, {
   3.965388500781437*^9, 3.965388556591858*^9}, {3.96538858768886*^9, 
   3.965388641886688*^9}, {3.965388696612608*^9, 3.9653887472841015`*^9}, 
   3.9653888128192616`*^9, {3.9653888445259457`*^9, 3.9653888457808743`*^9}, {
   3.965388891556259*^9, 3.9653889256260166`*^9}, {3.9805183132820415`*^9, 
   3.9805183160947685`*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"9a100136-7835-fc44-825e-a32ab6b0e2a0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
     RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", "\[LongEqual]", 
       FractionBox[
        StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
          StyleBox["A", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
       FractionBox[
        StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["l", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
   "\\gamma = \\frac {W} {\\Delta A} = \\frac {F} {l}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
  "TeXAssistantTemplate"]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980518308735647*^9, 3.980518311754734*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"4c5b1711-1864-ea4c-8c57-7a767b30d829"],

